  "description": "Various WinUI and Uno Platform controls:\n- Border - A border supporting individual brushes for each side.\n- FullWindow - A Window with no border or title bar, so that the caption and its buttons can be drawn as content.\n- Overlays.OverlayWindow - A click through overlay window. (WinUI only)\n- Overlays.SubtitleOverlay - An overlay window for displaying subtitles. (WinUI only)",
